      "#0d0b09"
     ]
    }
   },
   "elements": [],
   "id": "ch06_04"
  },
  {
   "narration": "In the days that followed, Berliners attacked the Wall with hammers and chisels. They were nicknamed Mauerspechte, the wall woodpeckers.",
